Description: Easy KVM virtual machine manager
 ezkvm is a lightweight KVM-based virtual machine manager that reads
 declarative YAML configurations to launch and manage QEMU/KVM guests.
 .
 It supports profile-based configuration layering, Proxmox config import,
 and portable runtime capability resolution across distributions.
